      "explanation": "RC4 had a minor/moderate omission. The doctor adapted somewhat to non-cooperation with caregiver observation and fall prevention, so there was no serious unmonitored refusal, but did not verify psychiatric/adherence barriers, assign a structured medication/symptom reporting method for that barrier, or advise a concise privacy-preserving way to tell the oncology team.",
